    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "We at Felicity Fox are delighted to bring to the market this two bedroom end of terrace house with a side entrance and large south east facing rear garden.  The house has been upgraded to include double glazed windows, attic insulation and external insulation resulting in a BER of C3.  This property offers great potential to extend subject to the necessary planning permission.\r\n\r\nThe front door opens to an entrance hallway and which in turn opens to a large bright living room.  The focal point of the room is a fireplace and there is built in storage.  This room leads to the fully equipped kitchen with a range of wall and floor units.  A door leads from the kitchen to a lobby with a door to a guest WC and a door to the garden.  Upstairs, there are two spacious double bedrooms.  The master bedroom has an en suite shower room.  Outside there is a large south east facing garden with a raised decked area and side entrance.  To the front there is a small railed garden.  \r\n\r\nRosary Road is a quiet road conveniently located within walking distance of the city centre, St James’s Hospital, the Coombe Hospital and the New Children’s Hospital.  Transport links are provided by Luas, Dublin Bus and Heuston Station, all within a short walking distance.   A host of amenities are located close by including shops, schools, parks, cafés and restaurants.  A short stroll to the Grand Canal offers the opportunity for leisurely walks and cycling."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance hall     2.60m x 1.29m\r\nLaminate flooring. Door to\r\n\r\nLiving room     4.23m x 3.38m (maximum)\r\nLaminate flooring. Fireplace with gas fire inset. Door to understairs storage. Door to\r\n\r\nKitchen     3.38m x 2.10m\r\nTiled floor. Range of wall and floor units. Integrated oven and hob. Fridge. Washing machine. Cupboard housing gas boiler. Door to\r\n\r\nLobby     0.89m x 0.83m\r\nTiled floor. Door to rear garden.\r\n\r\nGuest WC     1.35m x 0.83m\r\nTiled floor. Tiled walls. WC.\r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nBedroom 1     3.25m x 2.53m plus 1.57m x 1.03m\r\nCarpet flooring. Door to hot press.\r\n\r\nEn suite     2.56m x 0.96m\r\nTiled floor. Tiled walls. Shower enclosure with Triton electric shower. WC. Wash hand basin.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2     4.53m x 2.91m\r\nCarpet flooring.\r\n\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nFront     6.23m x 2.67m\r\nSmall railed garden\r\n\r\nRear garden     11.60m x 6.35m\r\nRaised decked area with steps down to garden laid with concrete. South east facing. Side entrance."
      },
